Hi there,

I'd just like to announce that I've just released the first public
copy of NetHack XP. NetHack XP is an unofficial replacement executable
for the official NetHack graphical client for Windows, designed to
enhance the appearance of the application. Here's a list of features:

    * Has a new icon, which has XP–compatible 32bit formats
    * Uses the visual style engine built in to Windows XP and later
    * Internal image–based checkbox widgets restyled to match XP's
      default visual style
    * New splash screen artwork
    * New game–over screen artwork
    * Uses Tahoma as the default dialog font (instead of
      MS Sans Serif)
    * Resizable frames (used for inventory lists, etc) have been
      replaced with resizable modal dialog boxes

You can find more information, screenshots and the download on the
official site:

http://www.redbrick.dcu.ie/~element/nethackxp/

